  "method": [
    "Frozen, private GrandAngle snapshot from 2026-10-22, not current production traffic. No production configuration was changed.",
    "The rendered corpus has 10512 documents, all without TOC. Its original collection excluded one page on an unconfigured host.",
    "Component split timings use every twentieth document (526 cases), five interleaved repetitions per backend, a reused worker and an independent ArrayAdapter for each warm backend. Every output digest matches PHP.",
    "Render accesses body, content parts and TOC; aggregate also accesses both paragraph views. These workloads must not be conflated.",
    "Full-page minification uses 63 evenly spaced exported HTML files (22265560 bytes) with whitespace inserted between tags. Three interleaved samples; every digest matches PHP.",
    "Article minification wraps each rendered corpus body in a complete HTML document. Each pass counts byte-equal and differing outputs directly.",
    "Complete builds use the same isolated application/vendor/catalogue, warmed container, fresh output directories and a fixed per-page PRNG seed in the benchmark copy. HTML, feeds, JSON, assets and compressed sidecars are included.",
    "Full-build comparison hashes every regular file and compares symlink targets; only the private static root in .Caddyfile is normalized.",
    "The 32-page profile records inclusive method time: nested values overlap and must not be added. It is diagnostic, not a benchmark speedup estimate.",
    "Shared workstation with other workloads, no CPU-frequency or thermal isolation. Full-build variations exceed the expected saving from these components; no reliable whole-site speedup is established."
  ],
